  "body": "Salvage follow-on for #7297 (queue task 14223).\n\nRestores the unique remainder of closed archive PR #7550 (`archive/janitor-2026-11-07/wt-currency-probe`, bulk-closed unmerged by the 2026-11-08 archive sweep): `pkgs/id/tests/probe_currency_validate.rs` (91 added lines, probe coverage showing `fold_authorisation` folds Live authorisations the conversion layer cannot honour).\n\nDoes NOT reopen #7550 or recreate its archive branch; #7550 remains the preservation record.\n\nVerification on current main:\n- `cargo test -p id`… run from `pkgs/id`: `cargo test --test probe_currency_validate` — 5/5 pass, no warnings\n- rustfmt (edition 2024) clean; `//!` module docs per sibling test convention\n- File confirmed absent from `origin/main` before re-apply (byte-identical to #7550 head apart from fmt/docs normalization)\n\nRefs #7297.\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1796792992&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=7963&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fcode&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fdeveloping-today%2Fcode%2Fpull%2F7963&signature=06d6b9cbe152a78c5b277e83c62e28026f1c5c58a7f6180440cc6eee04db684b\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Autofix with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark-3x.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"28\"></picture></a>\n<sup><a href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/developing-today/codesmith/code/pr/7963?autoLogin=true&ref=codesmith_pr_footer\">Open in [code]smith</a> · Need help on this PR? Tag <code>@codesmith-bot</code> with what you need.</sup>\n\n<!-- codesmith:autofix:disabled -->\n<!-- /codesmith:footer -->",
